a 40-token fact placed at random in a 30,000-token document

  chunk overlap chunks index size  fact cut  formula
    200       0    150      1.00x     19.3%    19.5%
    200      20    167      1.11x     10.7%    10.6%
    200      40    188      1.25x      0.0%     0.0%
    200      80    250      1.67x      0.0%     0.0%
    500       0     60      1.00x      7.8%     7.8%
    500      20     63      1.05x      3.8%     4.0%
    500      40     66      1.10x      0.0%     0.0%
    500      80     72      1.20x      0.0%     0.0%

with no overlap, a fact is cut roughly fact/chunk of the time; an overlap at least as
long as the fact means some chunk always holds it whole — at the price of a bigger index.
